0..79 Comment "//! A manifest model type: `Model(T) with sort x = A` is the type of the models"
80..159 Comment "//! of `T` whose sort `x` is `A`, the record of `T`\'s other components with `x`"
160..240 Comment "//! read as `A`, as `model-manifest.gandr`\'s ascription states it of a module. A"
241..318 Comment "//! chain, `with sort x = A with sort y = B`, fixes one sort per binding. The"
319..398 Comment "//! type is a family in `A`, so two sharings whose types are equivalent are one"
399..478 Comment "//! type along the equivalence, and a model of one is carried to a model of the"
479..558 Comment "//! other: the structure identity principle at a fixed sort (the HoTT book\'s §"
559..639 Comment "//! 2.14; cubical Agda\'s `Cubical/Foundations/SIP.agda`), after Leroy\'s manifest"
640..711 Comment "//! types [Leroy-1994-manifest_types_modules_and_separate_compilation]."
712..715 Comment "//!"
716..749 Comment "//! - see: #1480 — `secondLeft`"
750..783 Comment "//! - see: #2129 — `inlineLeft`"
784..857 Comment "//! - cites: [Leroy-1994-manifest_types_modules_and_separate_compilation]"
858..861 Comment "//!"
